---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { CHANGELOG } from "../data/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="更新日志" path="/changelog">
  <div class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>更新日志</h1>
      <p>只记录用户能感知的变化。内部重构不占版面。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <div class="wrap">
      {CHANGELOG.map((entry) => (
        <article class="log-entry">
          <h2>v{entry.version}</h2>
          <div class="log-date">{entry.date}</div>
          <ul>
            {entry.items.map((item) => (
              <li>{item}</li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </article>
      ))}

      <div class="note">
        客户端内的「版本更新」页会从你配置的服务器拉取同样的版本说明；未配置服务器时只展示本地记录。
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
